msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Saved: its cover, background and details are fetched again when PC5 opens."
msgstr ""
"Tallennettu: sen kansikuva, tausta ja tiedot haetaan uudelleen, kun PC5 "
"avautuu."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:153
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Cleared: PC5 reads the game's folder again."
msgstr "Tyhjennetty: PC5 lukee pelin kansion uudelleen."

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:155 title/pc5_web_page.html:180
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:268
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not saved: %s"
msgstr "Ei tallennettu: %s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:158
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "; GOG product %s"
msgstr "; GOG-tuote %s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:159
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"PC5 picks the game's cover, background and details by this number (%s%s). "
"If they are another game's, type the number from the game's Steam store "
"link (store.steampowered.com/app/<number>). Empty: PC5 reads the folder "
"again."
msgstr ""
"PC5 valitsee pelin kansikuvan, taustan ja tiedot tämän numeron perusteella "
"(%s%s). Jos ne kuuluvat toiseen peliin, kirjoita numero pelin Steam-kaupan "
"linkistä (store.steampowered.com/app/<numero>). Tyhjä: PC5 lukee kansion "
"uudelleen."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:178
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saved: used at the game's next start."
msgstr "Tallennettu: käytetään pelin seuraavassa käynnistyksessä."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:191
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Files: change a game's text files"
msgstr "Tiedostot: muuta pelin tekstitiedostoja"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:196
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Game folder"
msgstr "Pelin kansio"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:196
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Windows (registry, saves, settings)"
msgstr "Windows (rekisteri, tallennukset, asetukset)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:224
msgctxt "web"
msgid "This folder is empty"
msgstr "Kansio on tyhjä"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:235
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Larger than 8 MB: too large to change here"
msgstr "Yli 8 Mt: liian suuri muutettavaksi täällä"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:239
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not shown: %s"
msgstr "Ei näytetty: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:253
msgctxt "web"
msgid "UTF-8 with its mark"
msgstr "UTF-8 ja BOM"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:254
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Western (one byte a letter)"
msgstr "Länsimainen (tavu kirjainta kohden)"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:255
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"%s · %s line ends · %d lines · %s. Saved as it was: the same encoding and "
"line ends. A game reads it at its next start."
msgstr ""
"%s · %s-rivinvaihdot · %d riviä · %s. Tallennetaan ennallaan: sama "
"merkistö ja rivinvaihdot. Peli lukee sen seuraavalla käynnistyskerralla."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:257
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Sulje"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:265
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saved."
msgstr "Tallennettu."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:273
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Close without saving the changes?"
msgstr "Suljetaanko tallentamatta muutoksia?"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:278
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Wine writes its .reg files while a game plays: change them only when no "
"game is running."
msgstr ""
"Wine kirjoittaa .reg-tiedostojaan pelin aikana: muuta niitä vain, kun "
"mikään peli ei ole käynnissä."

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:280
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not opened: %s"
msgstr "Ei avattu: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:283
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Text files only (.ini, .cfg, .txt, .json, .reg and the like), up to 8 MB. "
"The console's File manager changes them too, a line at a time."
msgstr ""
"Vain tekstitiedostot (.ini, .cfg, .txt, .json, .reg ja vastaavat), "
"enintään 8 Mt. Konsolin tiedostonhallinta muuttaa niitä myös, rivi "
"kerrallaan."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:294
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No games yet."
msgstr "Ei vielä pelejä."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:297
msgctxt "web"
msgid "USB drive"
msgstr "USB-asema"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:298
msgctxt "web"
msgid "can't start"
msgstr "ei käynnisty"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:303
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Settings: %s"
msgstr "Asetukset: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:306
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Newest log"
msgstr "Uusin loki"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:308
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Report a problem"
msgstr "Ilmoita ongelmasta"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:309
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Downloads the newest log and opens GitHub's form, filled in: attach the "
"log there."
msgstr ""
"Lataa uusimman lokin ja avaa GitHubin valmiiksi täytetyn lomakkeen: liitä "
"loki sinne."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:315
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Launch options (launch.txt)"
msgstr "Käynnistysvalinnat (launch.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:316
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"The first line that isn't empty or a comment (# or ;) is added to the "
"program's command line."
msgstr ""
"Ensimmäinen rivi, joka ei ole tyhjä tai kommentti (# tai ;), lisätään "
"ohjelman komentoriville."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:320
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Environment variables (env.txt)"
msgstr "Ympäristömuuttujat (env.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:320
msgctxt "web"
msgid "One NAME=value a line, set before the game starts."
msgstr "Yksi NIMI=arvo riviä kohden, asetetaan ennen pelin käynnistymistä."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:321
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Extra logging (winedebug.txt)"
msgstr "Lisälokitus (winedebug.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:322
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Only when an issue asks for it, for example err+all,+seh. Empty it "
"afterwards: it slows the game down."
msgstr ""
"Vain kun issue pyytää sitä, esimerkiksi err+all,+seh. Tyhjennä se "
"jälkeenpäin: se hidastaa peliä."

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:327
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The games didn't load: %s"
msgstr "Pelit eivät latautuneet: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:340
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No logs kept."
msgstr "Lokeja ei ole säilytetty."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:344
msgctxt "web"
msgid "had a problem"
msgstr "oli ongelma"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:347
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The logs didn't load: %s"
msgstr "Lokit eivät latautuneet: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:356
msgctxt "web"
msgid "the connection was lost"
msgstr "yhteys katkesi"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:373
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Sending %d of %d: %s"
msgstr "Lähetetään %d/%d: %s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:377
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Stopped at %s: %s"
msgstr "Pysähtyi kohdassa %s: %s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:384
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Sent %d files (%s). PC5 asks to install the game in a moment."
msgstr "Lähetetty %d tiedostoa (%s). PC5 kysyy pian, asennetaanko peli."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:393
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Type the game's folder name first (no / or \\)."
msgstr "Kirjoita ensin pelin kansion nimi (ei / tai \\)."

